9","text":"<p>Include 25 kits of the DrugSense DSO8+ saliva drug test, which can detect AMP, COC, MET, OPI, THC, BZO, OXY, K2 & alcohol. Easy-to-use, non-invasive and verified to AS\/NZS4760:2019.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn more about DSO8+ saliva test ","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/drugsense-dso8-plus"}},"column_7EycFY":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/calibration-management-handheld.jpg","media_scale":100,"heading":"1 year calibration plan","text":"<p>Includes one calibration within a 12-month period with a NATA calibration certificate, priority calibration, express two-way shipping, online training resources, batteries and mouthpieces, extended sensor warranty, and support from a dedicated account manager.<\/p>","button_label":"Learn more about the calibration plan","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/calibration-plan-andatech-handheld"}},"column_gibtHe":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/alcosense-surety-online-training_50dbe314-aa72-4302-bcb7-d9d528128947_1.jpg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Online breathalyser training","text":"<p>Train staff on alcohol breath testing and how to use the Andatech Surety breathalyser to conduct alcohol testing properly. Complete the course online in your own time. Access to our training portal will be sent via email after purchase.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"column_A89Kd8":{"type":"column","settings":{"enable_media":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/andatech-surety-mouthpiece_fbd2aaaa-72cd-4a43-9432-b26747e896bd_1.jpg","media_scale":100,"heading":"Pack of 100 mouthpieces","text":"<p>Get a pack of 100 Surety mouthpieces with your starter pack, so you can get started on alcohol testing as soon as you receive the delivery.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"column_KWk6XR":{"type":"column","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_media":false,"media_scale":100,"heading":"","text":"","button_label":"","